Third-party code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. This package ships no code copied from DSH or from any other project.

lib/client.js is written for this package. It *calls* the DSH browser module
table (`react`, `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives`) and registers an action
into the `deliverables.file.actions` slot that the shipped
`@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-deliverables` exposes and renders — using the public
plugin surface, not a copy of the upstream implementation.

Earlier releases (0.1.x) vendored the browser bundle of
`@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-open-in-app` (MIT, Copyright (c) DeepSeek) and spliced
additive hunks into it. 0.2.0 removed that path; no such code remains in this
repository or in the published package.

No other third-party code is included. This package has no runtime dependencies.
